  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "This register finds 81 financial relationships in which Nvidia has put money, credit or demand behind companies in the AI buildout, and every number on this page links to its source.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": 81,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "81",
          "measure": "count"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Of the amounts that can be confirmed, $30.2 billion is invested and still held, $37.7 billion is committed, and $107.4 billion is contingent on events such as a tenant's default.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": 30196314380.28435,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$30.2 billion",
          "measure": "funded"
        },
        {
          "value": 37700000000.0,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$37.7 billion",
          "measure": "committed"
        },
        {
          "value": 107360340000.0,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$107.4 billion",
          "measure": "contingent"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "$105 billion of the contingent amount is a guaranty of OpenAI's rent that is signed but not yet in force.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": 105000000000.0,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$105 billion",
          "measure": "contingent",
          "rels": [
            "rel_openai_gu_2026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Announcements add up to $307.1 billion, which is never counted as exposure; $103.5 billion of it is letters of intent or deals with no disclosed agreement.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": 307092739346.78,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$307.1 billion",
          "measure": "headline"
        },
        {
          "value": 103500000000.0,
          "eligible_only": true,
          "text": "$103.5 billion",
          "measure": "headline",
          "rels": [
            "rel_openai_eqc_2025",
            "rel_wayve_eqc_2025",
            "rel_meta_eq_2026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nvidia's own accounts show more than any outsider can name: it paid $58.1 billion for equity in the nine months to 25 October 2026, and this register can tie $10.5 billion of that to named deals.",
      "figures": [
        {
          "value": 58100000000.0,
